Package: fleet-ansible
Version: 0.6.2
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Spoutin PKI & Fleet Team <admin@spoutin.org>
Depends: python3, python3-venv, openssh-client, sshpass, curl, jq, ca-certificates
Description: Spoutin Fleet Automation & SSH CA Trust Manager
 Automated fleet management and OpenSSH Certificate Authority trust deployment
 for the Spoutin Homelab. Discovers hosts dynamically via LAN-Orangutan,
 reads secrets from OpenBao, and configures SSH CA trust with zero-SSH Proxmox
 injection and network SSH fallback.
